WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:04.930
Miss Selena, you're a Diva candidate now.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:08.340
Never forget that every word you say 
and every move you make is watched.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:08.880
Yes.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.160
Always be elegant.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:10.850
Yes.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.180
Be the pride of the Bird People.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:13.590
Yes.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:14.620
Miss Selena!

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:15.160
Miss Selena!

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.700
Miss Selena!

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.510
Miss Selena!

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.160
Watch out.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.180
Good.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.170
Their new home wasn't destroyed.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:45.160
Wh-What are you doing?

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.140
Watching bugs.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.190
Bugs?

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:55.040
I like to come to this forgotten 
place and relax like this.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:58.480
Particio is a bright, wonderful place,

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.830
but sometimes it feels busy.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.480
I understand that.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.580
This place feels so relaxing.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:26.190
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:49.440
<b>The King of the Song Altar and the Diva in a Cage (Part 2)</b>

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:49.280
U-Um... Selena-san?

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.470
Leave me alone. I keep telling you that.

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:58.090
Forna, you're such a softy.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.230
Lupie-san!

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:02.670
Ever since Antel-san's first show,

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.520
Selena-san ain't left 
her room. I'm worried!

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.020
She's very concerned with her image.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:13.540
She thought nobody noticed her 
in the audience at Antel's show.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.270
She was probably there to 
see who he really was.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.130
Oh, right.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:27.610
The town's already talking about this 
potential marriage between two young Divas.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.250
Selena-sama and Antel-sama!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.240
Could there be a better couple?

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:37.520
But Selena-sama said she'd only sing 
a tune for someone worthy of her.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:41.930
Worthy of her? Antel-sama has the greatest 
voice of the Bird People, right?

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.800
If she refused,
wouldn't people think less of her?

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:49.090
Yes, there's no way she 
can turn down Antel-sama!

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.210
Right?

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:54.860
Those girls keep saying 
Antel-san's name, don't they?

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.580
It's strange that they don't notice.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.230
If there's something obvious about you,

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:02.680
that's what will draw people's attention.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.830
This is what a friend of mine said.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:10.340
Surprisingly, that's how 
beauty and ugliness work...

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.590
Even though nothing inside me has changed.

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.740
That aside.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.120
We need to talk about Voicia, right?

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.380
Yeah.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:29.870
Everybody's talking about y'all two 
Divas maybe getting married.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.120
So cheer up, Selena-san.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:37.780
You're still th' Diva that everybody loves.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:54.740
Please, open this door.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:05:03.250
I can't leave you alone in your suffering.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:08.620
Listen, this is just a passing dream.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:13.350
And this voice...

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:21.620
is something you can only hear in a dream.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.440
That song was terrible.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:44.370
You don't need to act so surprised.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:45.900
B-But...

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:50.410
Well, it wasn't <i>that</i> bad.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.240
What a purty room!

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:58.890
It's the first time anybody 
but me has ever been in here.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.370
"Listen, this is just a passing dream.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.850
And this voice is something 
you can only hear in a dream."

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.010
The song you just sang.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:14.100
If this is a passing dream...

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.430
Then I can tell you the truth.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.730
Something happened, and since then...

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:26.530
I've lost the power to sing.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:33.530
It was before I became a Diva.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.210
This is pretty embarrassing...

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.680
But the girl I liked turned me down.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:44.410
I couldn't sing,
because I'd never practiced.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.430
I hurt her.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:51.650
I regretted it so much that I asked 
a friend to help me learn to sing.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:55.680
They spent a lot of time in the theater.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.900
So they told me to come backstage.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.820
But I got lost...

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:04.670
And I found myself in that place you saw.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:24.630
The most noble thing in the world...

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:36.700
It is a beautiful singing voice.

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:43.430
That was the last day of my 
first performance as a Diva.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:48.190
I sang in front of a packed house.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:59.190
In this world, beauty is everything.

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:04.850
Praise it. Revere it.

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:05.670
And—

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.650
What?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:31.510
In this world, beauty is everything.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:43.410
Praise it. Revere it.
And look up to the heavens.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.450
Why are you singing with her voice?

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:53.790
I just stole the voice from the girl 
who was singing above my head.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.440
"Beauty is everything"?

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:00.560
What hateful words.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.840
I've been ugly since I was born.

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:08.550
Everyone laughed as they 
looked at me from afar.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:12.890
And now I've been sealed 
into an even uglier form.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:15.120
I understand your pain.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.380
You must've suffered so 
much alone down here.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.920
But if she can't sing, 
she'll cease to be a Diva.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.550
If that happens, Selena will...

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:33.010
A foolish bird, obsessed with love?

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:35.950
Very well. A trade, then.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:40.680
Use your song to destroy the 
rocks that surround my body.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.480
When I can spread my wings again,

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.190
I'll return this voice to the girl.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:54.200
All right. I promise.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.200
I'll come back. I swear it.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:10:00.200
And I'll save you from this darkness.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:04.710
Sing, then.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:09.910
For the ugly girl who lost her voice.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:15.750
So you couldn't sing no more 
after your first performance...

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:16.550
Yes.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:22.720
Then what was the voice I heard 
at Antel-sama's first show?

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.170
I don't know...

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.560
How could I?

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:30.170
I'm so sorry!

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:34.700
Um, have you known Antel-sama 
for a while now?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.660
Yes.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:40.460
Our parents made the decision 
before we ever saw each other.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:44.210
I didn't realize it was him, though.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:46.270
"Him"?

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:52.170
Antel once told me he loved me, and...

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:55.650
Y-Y-You threw his ring inta the lake?!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.670
Yes. The rumors spread quickly.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:02.040
And he left Particio.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:06.720
But he came back as a bona fide Diva!

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:12.640
He must've come back to get revenge!

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.490
So that's the promise you made?

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:19.020
I guess.

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:21.090
Um, Antel-san...

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.680
Can we help you?

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:28.520
That monster had such a sad voice.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.820
We can't just leave it!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.060
Thank you!

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.340
This beautiful voice...

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:56.470
Why, even when it's a part of me,

00:11:56.980 --> 00:12:00.200
do I still hate it and feel so sad?

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:05.780
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:15.490
So what am I doing out here in this crowd?

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:16.670
Here y'go!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.420
All th' bird girls love this right now!

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.260
It's so dang good!

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:27.680
G'won, try it!

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:32.490
It's good.

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:34.310
There ya go!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:40.340
Forna-san...

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.110
Yeah?

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:46.290
I'm grateful you took me 
out here to cheer me up.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:47.250
But...

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:50.250
That song of hatred I heard...

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.490
It's his revenge!

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:58.300
This time, he intends to reject me in 
front of everyone and embarrass me!

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:00.750
I ain't sure about that.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:04.490
Antel-sama didn't look like 
a man out for revenge!

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:07.450
There was kindness in his singin'.

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:09.270
You don't understand!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.240
I'm a Diva.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.440
Everything I do is watched.

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:16.510
And if anything happens,
the canaries spread rumors about me.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:18.730
I cannot be shamed.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.380
Antel is more attractive than myself.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.690
I need to be the one to propose to him.

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:27.900
And...

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:31.370
I have to win him with my song.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:33.970
But...

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.220
Right now, I...

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.610
I'm so sorry!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:44.090
Your singing is my only hope.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:50.630
<i>I'm seein' what she's been 
hidin' in her heart for so long.</i>

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.810
<i>Lupie-san sure was right.</i>

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.160
<i>She's a scared girl who's worried 
'bout what everybody else thinks.</i>

00:13:56.160 --> 00:14:02.680
<i>But once I sang t' show 
off for Lupie-san, too.</i>

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.890
<i>So we're even!</i>

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:08.610
Selena-san, I'll start workin'
 harder at my lessons!

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:12.410
My songs are all yours!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:16.290
I can't let a Diva suffer embarrassment!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.670
Thank you, Forna-san.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.410
Aw, just call me Forna.

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:27.370
Okay, that's it for today's lessons!

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.340
Thank you much!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:32.350
I'll go bring Selena-san a nice cup of tea.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.080
So where did you go yesterday?

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:38.330
You don't need to hide it.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.150
You went out to go have some fun, right?

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:42.620
Ya knew?

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:45.530
Well, I'm not going to tell you 
what to do with your private life.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.890
No matter who you're with or what you do,

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:51.880
as long as you let me be 
your producer, I'm just fine.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.930
Antel-san is concentrating!

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:07.430
The deadline was after today's concert.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.210
I'm getting nervous!

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:13.890
You're not the one going out on stage.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:24.060
I can't... I can't wait anymore!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.470
You're not going to see 
the performance today?

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:36.040
Why would I...

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.780
Selena-san...

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:47.170
I have grown tired...

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.510
It's th' voice!

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.170
It's coming from below?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.510
No, Selena!

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:50.370
Selena-san?

00:15:49.280 --> 00:16:00.150
My body has grown old, hating the world...

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:57.880
Antel-san!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:21.840
My one tiny wish is that someone 
will destroy these stones.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:28.560
You interrupted my performance 
without an invitation?

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.430
Wh-What are you?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:34.170
You're the girl who became my voice?

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:39.970
A m-monster!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:44.640
The reason I can't sing...

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:51.350
Yes. I stole that horrible voice,
 which echoed from above.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:55.900
Well? This voice is beautiful, isn't it?

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:59.370
With this, I can have everything I want!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.340
Yes, like this!

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:06.960
Selena-san!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.250
Are you okay?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:24.930
Yuu!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.770
Why?

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:31.400
Why do you leave me?

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.530
I'm beautiful now! So why?

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.390
Why do you leave?

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:39.320
Voicia, I've returned.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:44.580
As you promised,
you're giving back her voice!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.050
Antel...

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.530
It doesn't matter.

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:52.870
Even the darkness overtakes me.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:57.380
This voice will remain mine!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:09.890
This heat within the stones...

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:25.740
It's like my heart is being set on fire!

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:36.730
Why must I be punished?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.190
This is...

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:38.170
It's like the negative feelings that built 
up within the stones are overflowing!

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:46.820
Oh stones, turn to ash...

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:39.670
Run!

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:40.900
But...

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:43.170
Selena-san, we gotta run!

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.520
Wait! Antel!

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:48.570
I'm sorry, Selena.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:53.430
I'm afraid there's only one seat,
 and it's been taken.

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:57.410
I'll sing for you another time.

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:00.020
What are you saying, Antel?

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:07.690
Thank you for finding my ring.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:22.230
I will sing for you...

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:26.050
My love for thee...

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:26.880
Hurry!

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:31.700
My love for you...

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:36.780
That weakness,

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:43.730
that pain, even your form...

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:54.930
I will love them forever.

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:22.420
We got to hear Selena-sama's songs again!

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:25.400
Yes! It's such a shame what 
happened to Antel-sama.

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:27.320
And right before his final performance.

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:29.440
I hope he gets better soon.

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:30.440
Yeah.

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:36.390
You're a fine singer, but you're nervous 
'cause it's been so long since you sang!

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:38.630
Y-Yes, I guess.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:41.860
I'm glad she can sing again.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:42.710
Yeah.

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:46.340
I like it! Let's go with it!

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:49.240
Bravo!

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:51.230
Perfect for a happy scene!

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:55.580
That's a very innovative 
method of producing.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.730
I like it.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:01.990
Remember, my job is to change 
mud into pure water.

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:06.600
Forna, it's time for you change, too.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.700
I'm getting your first performance ready.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.560
Yes or no?

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:13.940
Yes, sir!

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:14.970
Okay.

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:18.590
Antel can't talk, so instead...

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:20.510
Um...

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:21.920
Where's Antel?

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:22.780
Antel!

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.430
S-S-Selena-san?

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.850
Oh?

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:28.870
Is that...?

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.090
Selena-sama?!

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:39.400
Antel?

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.300
Um...

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:50.690
I... I've always...

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:52.740
w-wubbed you?!

00:21:55.800 --> 00:22:00.760
You found the courage 
to say those words here,

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:04.000
but...

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:20.020
<i>You shine like a jewel, 
beautiful and fragile...</i>

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:09.600
Thank you.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:23.360
If you stand so close,
you'll catch his sore throat.

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:26.420
S-Sore throat?

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:31.620
My sore throat was bothering me, so I'm 
going to see a doctor in the next town over.

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:34.110
I'll be back tomorrow.

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:47.600
<i>True feelings, the door is now opened.</i>

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:53.350
<i>I believe in that light, in that beauty.</i>

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:56.860
<i>The key is in my heart.</i>

00:22:56.860 --> 00:23:05.900
<i>The curtain rose and the light's 
coming in, shining on you.</i>

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:11.390
<i>The courage to take flight from your cage.</i>

00:23:12.220 --> 00:23:19.680
<i>Now let go of that passing dream.</i>

00:23:25.820 --> 00:23:27.070
It's me, Titi!

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:27.950
It's me, Chacha!

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:31.200
The musical ending was so wonderful!

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:35.260
Everybody was holding hands 
at the curtain call!

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:38.310
Next time: "The Angel Who Couldn't Fly and the 
Holy Wings of Ten Thousand Prayers."

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>The Angel Who Couldn't Fly and the Holy Wings of Ten Thousand Prayers (Part 1)</b>

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:40.040
Part 1!
